# Implementation Plan - Add Vibrant and Attractive Colors to OMS Icons

Enhance the visual appeal and semantic clarity of the Portmantos Order Management System (OMS) interface by modernizing the color registry for all system icons exported by [index.js](file:///d:/OMS/portmantos-oms-ui/src/icons/index.js).

Currently, all icons except `DELETE` inherit default neutral gray colors, which makes the UI feel flat and uniform. Applying a curated, modern, and harmonious palette will make elements instantly scannable, intuitive, and premium.

---

## Proposed Palette

We propose a color system featuring premium, high-contrast, yet soft hex colors. These are carefully selected to remain highly readable on both light and dark layouts.

### 1. Document / Printing / Assets (Teal & Blue-Grays)
These colors convey information, documentation, and hardware tasks.
*   **LABEL** (`ReceiptOutlinedIcon`): `#1e88e5` (Vibrant Cobalt Blue) - High visibility for key shipping label actions.
*   **PRINT** (`PrintOutlinedIcon`): `#546e7a` (Sleek Slate Blue-Gray) - Professional tone for hardware tasks.
*   **PREVIEW** (`VisibilityOutlinedIcon`): `#00acc1` (Vibrant Cyan) - Clean look for inspection/previewing.
*   **DOWNLOAD** (`GetAppIcon`): `#43a047` (Vivid Green) - Downward flow action.
*   **EXPORT** (`CloudDownloadOutlinedIcon`): `#0284c7` (Ocean Blue) - Clean look for cloud download/export tasks.

### 2. Fulfillment & Routing (Indigo & Violet)
These colors indicate logistics, navigation, and transit.
*   **SHIPMENT** (`LocalShippingIcon`): `#3f51b5` (Indigo Blue) - The core transit action.
*   **UPDATE_SHIP_BY_DATE** (`EventIcon`): `#e91e63` (Deep Pink) - High-contrast date indicator.
*   **UPDATE_SHIP_SENSE** (`AssignmentOutlinedIcon`): `#ab47bc` (Orchid Violet) - Automated shipping settings.
*   **LOCAL_STATUS** (`AssignmentOutlinedIcon`): `#78909c` (Soft Slate) - Informative local record state.
*   **REROUTE** (`NavigationOutlinedIcon`): `#fb8c00` (Vibrant Amber) - Direction change / caution.
*   **AUTOREROUTE** (`AutorenewOutlinedIcon`): `#26a69a` (Mint Teal) - Continuous automation loop.
*   **ROUTING** (`ExploreOutlinedIcon`): `#0ea5e9` (Sky Blue) - Geolocation and routing.

### 3. Action / Transaction (Vivid Forest Green, Deep Pink, Royal Blue)
Interactive, status-modifying, or user-driven operations.
*   **CREATE** (`AddCircleOutlinedIcon`): `#2e7d32` (Forest Green) - Action to add/create records.
*   **EDIT** (`EditOutlinedIcon`): `#1565c0` (Royal Blue) - Action to modify records.
*   **DELETE** (`DeleteOutlineIcon`): `error` (Theme-native red) - Keeps native theme error color.
*   **UNDO** (`UndoOutlinedIcon`): `#607d8b` (Cool Gray) - Soft reset/revert action.
*   **SPLIT** (`CallSplitOutlinedIcon`): `#d81b60` (Vibrant Magenta) - Fork/split action.
*   **SHUFFLE** (`ShuffleOutlinedIcon`): `#8e24aa` (Deep Violet) - Randomizing / re-matching items.
*   **LOCATION_SEARCHING** (`LocationSearchingOutlinedIcon`): `#00acc1` (Bright Cyan) - Warehouse targeting.
*   **COLOR_LENS** (`ColorLensOutlinedIcon`): `#ff4081` (Hot Pink) - Design theme customizing.

### 4. Status / Alerts (Green, Red, Orange)
Critical status indicators and system health alerts.
*   **RESOLUTION** (`DoneAllOutlinedIcon`): `#2e7d32` (Forest Green) - Complete success / resolved status.
*   **ISSUE** (`ReportProblemOutlinedIcon`): `#f4511e` (Sunset Orange) - Warning / system issue.
*   **PRIORITY** (`PriorityHighOutlinedIcon`): `#e53935` (Crimson Red) - Urgent / critical priority attention.
*   **ONLINE_STATUS** (`DescriptionOutlinedIcon`): `#546e7a` (Slate Blue-Gray) - Standard online state.

### 5. Facility & Finances (Teal & Warm Earth)
Special categories for external contexts.
*   **FDD** (`HomeWorkOutlinedIcon`): `#5d4037` (Warm Earth-Brown) - Facilities and buildings.
*   **INTERNATIONAL** (`PublicOutlinedIcon`): `#00897b` (Deep Teal) - Overseas / borders.
*   **UPDATE_SHIPPING_RATES** (`LocalAtmOutlinedIcon`): `#43a047` (Currency Green) - Financial transactions and rates.

