## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> All hex values have been tested to ensure high contrast against both bright white (Light Mode) and charcoal-black (`#1E2125`/`#121212`) backgrounds used in the Fuse React system.

> [!TIP]
> The Material UI (MUI) wrappers handle these colors gracefully. Any color that isn't native (e.g. not `'primary'`, `'secondary'`, etc.) is injected cleanly into the `style.color` prop by our [Icon.jsx](file:///d:/OMS/portmantos-oms-ui/src/icons/Icon.jsx) component.

