## Proposed Changes

### Icon System

#### [MODIFY] [index.js](file:///d:/OMS/portmantos-oms-ui/src/icons/index.js)
Apply the customized color palette to the `ICON_REGISTRY` mapping object by populating or adding `color` under each icon's `defaultProps`.

